# Trivy ignore list for the image scan gate in .github/workflows/deploy.yml (ADR-0078 #4).
# Same discipline as osv-scanner.toml: every entry names the package, the reason, and
# when to revisit; docs/security/audit-exceptions.md carries the full rationale.

# @fastify/static@9.3.0 (API image) — the patched line is v10, which @nestjs/swagger's
# peer range (v8 || v9) rejects; adopting it breaks Swagger UI. No wildcard or
# user-controlled static path is served through it. Revisit when @nestjs/swagger
# supports @fastify/static@10. (OSV: GHSA-83w8-p2f5-377r / GHSA-8pvw-jcv7-9cmj.)
CVE-2026-15074
